        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gweaydeaba ispwa",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Muudeanooda gilakweaydeaba ispwa gaysina gheata siksiinda. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gichea siksiinda ea nih gil: gilinyoo ea siida gil niilaach gida gayghoadayda gida alaach aba heeda giischeewoocheandaanyi; adagageanda aba heeda giischeewoocheandaanyi, ghana orjeeda ghaamwat, aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA siksiindaanyi goola eergu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba rabascheanda giimuusi nung' gagoonyi, nea aba gida ghayi was daang'u mideawa orjeeda geamadu gaygwasiksa geatindaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nea jeedeang'wa ea maygwanda fuga barbari (aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA gaygagoonyi ghawooda aba jeeda ng'eanyiida jea gagoonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U ak goombali nea goohearanyi), ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gaysisiina mureeda ng'asheega ghuuta NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak giing'waanyi diigheanyeekaaschi sean earukuneey askweareaniin. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.5"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygagoonyi ghawooda, gawuurji gida ghayi rukuneey, ak ang'iing'i gayghara eemoojiga saang'a, ak ang'iing'i ea majalaaja; nea ang'iing'i gajambala eemoojiga saang'a, nea saawa ea mayghoamu goombalnyi.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.6"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Aba inyas gwanda bugusteang'wa siida bwarbwar, was siida buweacheandaang'u, nea gwanda jeemba gheawagi aba jeeda gealgaagu, aba ng'eanyiida goonyi NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, adiidu giihang'waanyi gurooroadaang'u nea adiidu gimughudi geatingaagu siida bwarbwar was orjeeda geamadu, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "gajatiisiina geatingaagu niny ak ghoalaach gea deay aba gida gasa niny, ea gichea gawuurji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ng'ula adiidu gwanda gurooroadaang'u ng'asheanda muy mii doabiiwaat, ak giyeeni, ‘gweaydeaba ispwa, gweayda siksiinda gil niriighu,’ ak giimunyasiidayi gheanyangaagu aba heeda siida bwarbwar bea eemeadaang'u, ak gaygooyeawusa NG'UTAMIIDA aba badaydaang'u, ak abeeda gayghoah riing'eeda aba headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.9"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Adawa mwadaagha, nea adiidu ghwasach ghaat gurooroadaang'u damanda iidawi; abeeda aba sareani NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygabadiischeesa gadiyoojigaagu ea gilinyoo ang'waanyana geadi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Aba gideaba fuga barbari maygoosha aba jeeda ng'eanyiida; ak ghamneawa gearukuneey gideaba gajahiisiina geatingaagu orjeeda geamadu ea siida gasa weeta ea siida bwarbwar, aba jeeda ng'eanyiida.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Gichea eesima soomjooga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Inyas gishaahi siida eemeadaang'u was ng'eedeeda Ebraniya, ghanea gatmooda Ebraniya, gaygagadiyeeseey gweanyeew lah, ama gweaydeaba ispwa gaysiksiina gawa ghabeawa headaang'u. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.12"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Damanda jea nung' ghabeawa headaang'u iisiksi abeeda adiidu ginung' gawa nea ghaghus geatinga, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "ak gayng'ula aba baydeayda ak aba jeeda hawandaang'u ea booga ea gidasimanmana difaayeadaang'u gajadawa aba gideaba NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajapkaada gideaba agooga ghayi goowooschi soomjooga aba ng'eanyiida Misri, ak gooruuneey NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U, ak ghamneawa gearukuneey ng'asheanji. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gwayeeshiineey, ‘Aniini maydang'amwa hiji,’ aba gideaba ghaabwariinyeey ang'iing'i ea fugeaba gheang'u, aba gideaba ghwanyas miyeenooda aba headaang'u, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "abeeda giyaadi gidaghuuteaba gheang'u ak gisaawi iita; abeeda gayghoah soomjeandaang'u damanda manda muudeanooda. Ak eara gatmooda was soomjeanda eara ada gihindunu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.17"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Majea hang'waay aba headaang'u, iisiksi gawa ghang'amwa headaang'u goobal geaw aba gideaba niny nigadiyeeseey gweanyeew lah burdeawa niba iyeenya bea siida gadiyeeda. Abeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gaygagoonyi ghawooda aba gilinyoo sina.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s1"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Duweachajeega dugwa ea gea gisilga",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.18"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "“Duweachajeega sean was heewga ea lagweendiga siji aba jeeda hawandaang'u gaysaja ghoah gea NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U; adiidu gigadiyeati duweachajeega dugwaagu nea adiidu gilaji buudeega duweachajeega gisilgaagu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gajaga, ang'iing'i ea fugeaba gheang'u, aba madeeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U gilakweay, aba heeda jea ghwaloat NG'UTAMIIDA. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.20"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Inyas gwandeawa badeeda wassean, ghana gwajikta ghana ea ng'oaw, ghana gwandeawa badeeda wassean muy, adiidu giidaydi ghoah lukghumeeda aba heeda NG'UTAMIIDA was ASEATAANG'U. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.21"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ak gayjaksiina jeesinga mujiinajeagaagu gea mideawa badeeda ea gea mandeawana gajaga, gawuurji gidiyaakti ndoopkeeda ea ulaysi. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.22"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "DEU 15:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidamajaga foojeandaanyi gil gajahiisiina ng'eanyi gawuurji beega.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "DEU.15.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "DEU.15.23"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
